---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Clear North"
  description="Privacy Policy for Clear North: Aurora Alerts, an iPhone aurora alert app."
>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&display=swap" />
  <div class="cn">
  <div class="container section">
    <span class="section-label">// clear north</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: September 23, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose privacy-prose">
      <div class="highlight-box">
        <strong>Summary:</strong> Clear North has no account, no tracking, no ads, and no analytics. To send alerts, our server stores an anonymous push token, an approximate 0.5&deg; grid cell, and your alert preferences. It never receives your precise location, and the data is never sold or linked to your identity.
      </div>

      <h2>What Our Server Stores</h2>
      <p>To deliver alerts, our server stores exactly the following for each device, and nothing else:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>An anonymous push (APNs) token.</strong> Apple issues this token so we can send a notification to your device. It does not identify you.</li>
        <li><strong>A 0.5&deg; grid cell.</strong> This is an area roughly 55 km by 40&ndash;55 km. It is never a precise location. The app rounds your location to this cell on your device and never sends precise coordinates.</li>
        <li><strong>Your alert preferences:</strong> nightly limit, quiet hours, the major-storm toggle, the dusk toggle, and your time zone.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Location</h2>
      <p>Clear North uses coarse (approximate) location only. It is used on your device to compute the grid cell described above. Precise coordinates are never sent to us or to anyone else.</p>

      <h2>Account, Tracking, Ads, and Analytics</h2>
      <p>There is no account and no sign-in. Clear North has no tracking, no advertising, and no analytics SDKs. Your data is never sold, and it is never linked to your identity.</p>

      <h2>Data Sources</h2>
      <p>Cloud forecasts come from <a href="https://api.met.no/">MET Norway</a> (licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>). Geomagnetic data comes from the <a href="https://www.swpc.noaa.gov/">NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center</a>. Clear North is not endorsed by MET Norway or NOAA.</p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>A device record is deleted when you turn alerts off or delete it in the app, or when Apple reports the push token as invalid. A record is also removed after 90 days of inactivity.</p>

      <h2>Deleting Your Data</h2>
      <p>Turn off alerts in the app to delete your device record. You can also email <a href="mailto:matt@mattdonders.com?subject=Clear%20North%20Privacy">matt@mattdonders.com</a> and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>Purchases</h2>
      <p>Subscriptions and purchases are handled by Apple through StoreKit. The developer receives no payment details. Apple&rsquo;s handling of purchase information is covered by <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">Apple&rsquo;s Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Clear North is not directed at children.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the updated text and date will appear on this page.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:matt@mattdonders.com?subject=Clear%20North%20Privacy">matt@mattdonders.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cn {
    --bg: #080b14;
    --surface: #10141f;
    --border: #232a3b;
    --text: #ece6d8;
    --text-muted: #b4aea0;
    --accent: #86e8b0;
    --accent-hover: #a8f0c6;
    --accent-dim: rgba(134, 232, 176, 0.1);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .cn h1, .cn h2 { font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 500; }
  .last-updated { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem; }
  .privacy-prose h2 { margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; font-size: 1.35rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .privacy-prose p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .privacy-prose ul { margin: 0 0 1rem 1.25rem; }
  .privacy-prose li { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .highlight-box { background: var(--accent-dim); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius); margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .highlight-box strong { color: var(--text); }
</style>
